{"text": "The king had a beautiful daughter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Whose spirit was as fiery as his own. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He loved her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> More than anything in the world. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Among the kings servants. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was a young man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of low birth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was handsome and brave. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the princess loved him deeply. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her love was warm and strong. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And it had a great deal of fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king discovered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Their secret love. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Without a moments delay. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He threw the young man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Into prison. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A day was set. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For his trial. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the arena. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The fiercest tiger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the most beautiful young lady. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the land. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Were chosen for the doors. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everyone knew. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That the young man had loved the princess.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "a", " ", "b", "e", "a", "u", "t", "i", "f", "u", "l", " ", "d", "a", "u", "g", "h", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "o", "s", "e", " ", "s", "p", "i", "r", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "s", " ", "f", "i", "e", "r", "y", " ", "a", "s", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "o", "w", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "l", "o", "v", "e", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=",